# infralyte-www

- This is a from-scratch site. No Lovable components, CSS, meta tags, or hosting.
- Do not add `lovable.app` links, including for GharBazaar, FlowSpeak, or Briefly.
- Keep `/unsubscribe/`, `/scan/`, and `/offers/*` as real HTTPS pages.
- Do not name confidential customers or claim 20 AI transformations.
- Draft outreach only. This repo never sends outreach or bulk email.
- One exception: `functions/contact.js` may send a single transactional
  notification of an inbound enquiry to our own mailbox (`MAIL_TO`). The
  visitor's address is only ever `reply_to`, never `to`, so this path cannot be
  used to mail a prospect. Do not add any other sending path.
- Workspace and contact mail is `hello@infralyte.in`. Never `infralyte.com`.
